{"id":"d55cad2c-e51a-4f80-8313-6ab0267d36fe","createdAt":"2026-10-26T14:38:08.991Z","batchId":"onboarding_claude-sonnet-5-5_medium","approach":"html","modelId":"claude-sonnet-5-5","settings":{"effort":"medium"},"presetId":"onboarding","prompt":"A three-step onboarding wizard: account, preferences, done. Show the current step and next/back buttons.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\" style=\"max-width:640px\">\n<div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n<div>\n<h1 class=\"h1\">Set up your workspace</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">Three quick steps and you're ready to start tracking projects with your team.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n<div class=\"row between\">\n<strong id=\"stepName\">Step 1 of 3: Account</strong>\n<span class=\"muted small\" id=\"stepPct\">33% complete</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\"><div id=\"bar\" style=\"width:33%\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"row gap-sm\" id=\"crumbs\">\n<span class=\"badge\" data-c=\"1\">1 Account</span>\n<span class=\"badge badge-outline\" data-c=\"2\">2 Preferences</span>\n<span class=\"badge badge-outline\" data-c=\"3\">3 Done</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card\">\n<form id=\"wiz\" onsubmit=\"return false\">\n<section data-s=\"1\" class=\"stack\">\n<div>\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">Create your account</h3>\n<p class=\"card-desc\">We'll use this to sign you in and send receipts.</p>\n</div>\n<label>Full name<input id=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Priya Raman\" required></label>\n<label>Work email<input id=\"email\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"priya@northwind.io\" required></label>\n<label>Password<input id=\"pw\" type=\"password\" placeholder=\"At least 8 characters\" minlength=\"8\" required></label>\n<p class=\"small muted\">Use 8 or more characters with a mix of letters and numbers.</p>\n<div class=\"alert alert-destructive\" id=\"err\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<section data-s=\"2\" class=\"stack\" style=\"display:none\">\n<div>\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">Your preferences</h3>\n<p class=\"card-desc\">You can change any of these later in Settings.</p>\n</div>\n<label>Role\n<select id=\"role\">\n<option>Product manager</option>\n<option>Engineer</option>\n<option>Designer</option>\n<option>Founder</option>\n</select>\n</label>\n<label>Team size\n<select id=\"team\">\n<option>Just me</option>\n<option>2–10 people</option>\n<option>11–50 people</option>\n<option>50+ people</option>\n</select>\n</label>\n<div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n<strong class=\"small\">Notifications</strong>\n<label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"n1\" checked> Weekly progress digest</label>\n<label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"n2\" checked> Mentions and comments</label>\n<label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"n3\"> Product tips and updates</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n<strong class=\"small\">Theme</strong>\n<label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"th\" value=\"System\" checked> Match system</label>\n<label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"th\" value=\"Light\"> Light</label>\n<label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"th\" value=\"Dark\"> Dark</label>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section data-s=\"3\" class=\"stack\" style=\"display:none\">\n<div class=\"center stack\">\n<span class=\"avatar\" id=\"av\">P</span>\n<h3 class=\"card-title\" id=\"doneTitle\">You're all set!</h3>\n<p class=\"card-desc\">Your workspace is ready. Here's a summary of your setup.</p>\n</div>\n<table class=\"table\">\n<tbody>\n<tr><td class=\"muted\">Email</td><td id=\"sEmail\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"muted\">Role</td><td id=\"sRole\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"muted\">Team size</td><td id=\"sTeam\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"muted\">Notifications</td><td id=\"sNotif\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"muted\">Theme</td><td id=\"sTheme\"></td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"hr\"></div>\n<div class=\"row between\" id=\"nav\">\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-outline\" id=\"back\">Back</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"next\">Continue</button>\n</div>\n</form>\n</div>\n<p class=\"small muted center\">Need help? Contact support@northwind.io</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\nvar s=1,$=function(i){return document.getElementById(i)};\nvar names=[\"Account\",\"Preferences\",\"Done\"];\nfunction show(){\ndocument.querySelectorAll('[data-s]').forEach(function(e){e.style.display=e.dataset.s==s?'':'none'});\n$('stepName').textContent='Step '+s+' of 3: '+names[s-1];\nvar p=Math.round(s/3*100);\n$('stepPct').textContent=s==3?'Complete':p+'% complete';\n$('bar').style.width=p+'%';\ndocument.querySelectorAll('[data-c]').forEach(function(b){\nb.className='badge'+(b.dataset.c==s?'':(b.dataset.c<s?' badge-secondary':' badge-outline'))});\n$('back').style.visibility=s==1?'hidden':'visible';\n$('next').textContent=s==1?'Continue':s==2?'Finish setup':'Go to dashboard';\n}\n$('back').onclick=function(){if(s>1){s--;show()}};\n$('next').onclick=function(){\nif(s==1){\nvar e=$('err'),n=$('name').value.trim(),m=$('email').value.trim(),w=$('pw').value;\nvar msg=!n?'Please enter your name.':!/^\\S+@\\S+\\.\\S+$/.test(m)?'Please enter a valid email address.':w.length<8?'Password must be at least 8 characters.':'';\nif(msg){e.textContent=msg;e.style.display='';return}\ne.style.display='none';\n}\nif(s==2){\nvar f=$('name').value.trim().split(' ')[0];\n$('doneTitle').textContent=\"You're all set, \"+f+\"!\";\n$('av').textContent=f[0].toUpperCase();\n$('sEmail').textContent=$('email').value;\n$('sRole').textContent=$('role').value;\n$('sTeam').textContent=$('team').value;\nvar ns=[];['n1','n2','n3'].forEach(function(i,k){if($(i).checked)ns.push(['Digest','Mentions','Tips'][k])});\n$('sNotif').textContent=ns.length?ns.join(', '):'None';\n$('sTheme').textContent=document.querySelector('input[name=th]:checked').value;\n}\nif(s<3){s++;show()}else{$('next').textContent='Opening dashboard…';$('next').disabled=true}\n};\nshow();\n})();\n</script>","deltas":[[1833,"<div class=\"page\""],[2167," style=\"max-width:"],[2195,"640"],[2195,"px\">\n<"],[2195,"div class=\"stack g"],[2195,"ap-lg\">\n<div"],[2195,">\n<h1 class=\""],[2195,"h1\">Set up your work"],[2195,"space</h1>\n<"],[2195,"p class=\"lead\">"],[2195,"Three qu"],[2209,"ick steps and"],[2215," you're ready to start"],[2552," t"],[2553,"racking proj"],[2553,"ects with"],[2553," your team.</p>\n</"],[2553,"div>\n\n<div"],[2553," class=\"st"],[2553,"ack gap-sm\">"],[2553,"\n<div class=\"row between\">"],[2553,"\n<str"],[2553,"ong id=\"stepName"],[2584,"\">Step 1"],[2612," of 3: Account</"],[2913,"strong>\n<span class=\""],[2913,"muted small"],[2913,"\" id=\"st"],[2913,"epPct\">33"],[2913,"%"],[2919," complete</span>\n</div"],[2919,">\n<div class=\"progress"],[2919,"\"><div id=\"b"],[2926,"ar\" style=\"width:33%"],[2945,"\"></div></div>\n<"],[2987,"div class=\"row gap-s"],[3012,"m\" id=\"cr"],[3310,"umbs\">\n<span class"],[3310,"=\"badge\" data-c"],[3310,"=\"1\">1"],[3310," "],[3310,"Account</span>\n<span class"],[3310,"=\"badge badge-outline"],[3310,"\" data-c=\"2\">2"],[3311," Preferences</span>"],[3345,"\n<span class=\"badge bad"],[3383,"ge-outline\" data-c"],[3413,"=\"3\">3 Done</"],[3448,"span>\n</div>\n</"],[3675,"div>\n\n<div class=\"card"],[3675,"\">"],[3675,"\n<form id=\"wi"],[3676,"z\" onsubmit=\""],[3676,"return false\">"],[3676,"\n<section data-s=\"1"],[3679,"\" class=\"stack\">\n<"],[3744,"div"],[3760,">\n<h3 class=\""],[3795,"card-title\">Create your account"],[3824,"</h3>\n<p class"],[3848,"=\"card-desc\">We"],[4045,"'